                "description": "The Deltana made Interconnect Grade 2 Entry lever and lock features a simple rectangular shape that makes it a great choice for classic styled as well as more modern decors. The interconnected handleset is Panic Proof allowing you to simply turn your interior lever to open your door without having to unlock the deadbolt. Adjustable door thickness for 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. Available in Brushed Chrome or Polished Brass finish.",
